1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:03,642
Gaon mein kaam nahi, sheher mein rehne ko paise nahi.

2
00:00:03,942 --> 00:00:08,968
Lallan, sheher ka kachra hi tera khazana hai! Kabadi ka kaam shuru kar!

3
00:00:09,268 --> 00:00:11,939
Kabadi? Log kya kahenge, Pradhan ji?

4
00:00:12,239 --> 00:00:19,235
Log kuch nahi kahenge, paisa bolega! Rehdi, taraazu aur godown ka kiraya, 30 hazaar.

5
00:00:19,535 --> 00:00:26,301
Raddi, loha, plastic, sab alag-alag rakh. Alag karke bechoge, to zyada daam milega.

6
00:00:26,851 --> 00:00:30,547
Bhaiya, ye purane akhbaar, botlein aur toota cooler, sab le jao!

7
00:00:30,847 --> 00:00:34,715
Raddi 12 rupaye kilo, aunty ji. Ye lijiye, poore 200!

8
00:00:35,015 --> 00:00:40,438
Yahi maal aage factory ko zyada daam pe. Roz ₹1,500 se zyada.

9
00:00:40,738 --> 00:00:45,667
Society aur office se tie-up kar. Har hafte pakka maal milega.

10
00:00:45,967 --> 00:00:48,454
Kachre se kamai! Lallan ki life set!
